# F06: demo3 (e1m6) from 15 s: an ogre's chainsaw lands, the damage flash ("a gamepad").
# Slop, the status bar and the gun, id's recorded camera and its sound.
#
# Assembly (F06): a gamepad in bronze line art at the bottom right, on a dark band, shakes
# by up to 6 pixels for 0.3 s from each red damage flash, with "rumble" beside it.

demo demo3 from 15

duration 4
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud on
gun on
cvar gamma 0.8

sound on
events on
